### Register
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname": "demo_user", "password": "password123"}

### Copy the token and user_id returned above
@token = paste-token-here
@user_id = paste-user-id-here

### Roadmaps
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/roadmaps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pomodoro
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/pomodoro/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"duration_seconds": 1500}

### Pomodoro status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/pomodoro/status/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
